 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "article",
   "date": "2019-08-12",
   "date_label": "08/12/2019",
   "tags": [
    "User Report",
    "Presetting & Measuring"
   ],
   "title": "A Step Up in Setting",
   "lead": "<p><strong>SycoTec, a specialist in high-speed microdrives, can now preset its turning tools for machining dental components a good 30 percent faster than before. This is made possible by ZOLLER’s »hyperion«. The compact, high-precision measuring machine reduces the danger of tool breakage.</strong></p>",
   "images": [],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> A special challenge: multi-tool holders </h2>",
     "body": "<p>SycoTec’s long and universal lathes are equipped with both powered tools and stationary turning tools. The »hyperion« presetting and measuring machine from ZOLLER serves in all areas—both on Index universal lathes and in the long-turning sector with Star machines. Multi-tool holders, which provide space for multiple turning tools on a single holder, are used very frequently, especially with the latter.</p>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
     "pos": "text",
     "cols": 1,
     "valign": "top",
     "ftype": "text",
     "id": "c4011",
     "bg": "",
     "space": {
      "before": "default",
      "after": "default"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "<h2> Delicate parts for dental technology with small to medium-sized batch sizes </h2>",
     "body": "<p>When you look at a dentist’s hand-held device, you can only imagine how small the motors and drive units inside the device must be—especially since they perform highly precise work at rotational speeds of up to 500,000 <sup>min-1</sup>. In the idyllic town of Leutkirch in the Allgäu region, SycoTec manufactures precisely these components, among others, and faces some tricky challenges in the process. However, the company not only produces intricate components for dental technology but has also become one of the world’s largest suppliers of high-speed drives. The business division encompasses a broad spectrum of customized electric drives and motor components, ranging all the way to turbogenerators and special-purpose motors. </p> <p>The third pillar of the business, “Components,” also requires a great deal of expertise and experience. All technologies, including milling, turning, grinding, honing, laser welding, deep drawing, and robotic welding, are available. Handling the wide variety of static and rotating tools used on the numerous machine tools poses an especially significant challenge for SycoTec. Furthermore, delicate components with very low tolerances must be manufactured in small to medium batch sizes—all while maintaining high efficiency.</p>",
     "images": [],
     "videos": [],
